    "body": "Administrators can now change an unrouted cargo’s arrival deadline directly from the Not Routed Cargo table. The interaction follows the existing destination-edit dynamic-dialog pattern and remains confined to that table.\n\n- **Deadline affordance**\n  - Replaced plain deadline text with a PrimeFaces command link.\n  - Opens `changeArrivalDeadlineDateDialog` with the cargo tracking ID.\n  - Displays the existing edit icon and tooltip:\n    `Click to change cargo arrival deadline date.`\n\n- **Dialog return**\n  - Handles `dialogReturn` through the established deadline-dialog launcher.\n  - Refreshes `tableNotRouted` after a successful dialog close.\n\n```xhtml\n<p:commandLink id=\"arrivalDeadlineToUpdate\"\n    action=\"#{changeArrivalDeadlineDateDialog.showDialog(cargoNotRouted.trackingId)}\">\n    <h:outputText value=\"#{cargoNotRouted.arrivalDeadlineDate}\" />\n    <i class=\"fa fa-edit\" style=\"color: #999999;\" />\n    <p:ajax event=\"dialogReturn\"\n        listener=\"#{changeArrivalDeadlineDateDialog.handleReturn}\"\n        update=\"tableNotRouted\" />\n</p:commandLink>\n```\n\n- **Documentation**\n  - Added the Administration capability note for changing an unrouted cargo’s arrival deadline.\n\n<!-- START COPILOT CODING AGENT SUFFIX -->\n\n- Fixes #14",
